{"version":1,"content":"<p>卸任英偉達CEO的黃仁勳，就連自身持有的英偉達3.58%股份也無法自由處置。雖然他是英偉達最大個人股東，但絕大部分股份放在由他與妻子洛麗・黃（Lori Huang）共同管理的信託中。出售股票、行使投票權，實際上都需要洛麗・黃同意。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586254.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:58:44.788964+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:32:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:01.426993+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:01.426993+00:00","content_hash":"da02e4505991f007fa6d586eeb9a88659840103b58860fe5c81d46dbff1c60e5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}